      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've tried before to get physbones to sync properly with the network id editor thing, but never succeeded. \n\nMight of course also have been affected by things like VRCFury or Modular Avatar. But optimally there would be a way so that tools like that can still be used without losing the ability to sync physbones correctly (maybe it'd be easier to implement a VRCFury feature that removes PBs for Quest build or only adds the PC-only ones on PC without messing up the network IDs or something..)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
