      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2a4df969e04460cfc5e29d|full_name} Are you sure you assigned the corresponding network IDs to each gameobjects? they must use the same ID both on PC and on Quest for the specific parts.\n\nAlso it wouldn't be that easy to just remove the Quest PhysBones and adding it with a PC ones where most avatar creators usually just toss in 50 or more PhysBone components, and hundreds and more PhysBone transforms on the avatar. Quest is very limited, you can't exceed 8 PB components and 64 PB transforms, so you have to do a manual work, because the system wouldn't know what PBs you would want to keep for the Quest version",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
