  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "What happens if the Android version of an avatar has fewer physbones than the PC version?   I suspect that physbone interactions can't *all* just be calculated locally, since for example, late joiners need to be able to see posed physbones....   Are they synced based on an index, or on the bone name, or what?",
